[{"id":4259421769,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc794Z5J","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Thanks for working on this functionality! It mostly works, but I have a few notes:\n\n- All three actions are saved individually per node to the undo redo history, so hitting `Ctrl` + `Z` reverts the changes to the nodes one by one. The expected behavior is that one `Ctrl` + `Z` reverts the entire operation.\n- When you select a mix of nodes that have and don't have Editable Children or Load as Placeholder enabled, the checkbox shows the checkbox with the checked state, even though the partial checkbox state is expected.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119347#pullrequestreview-4259421769","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119347","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119347#pullrequestreview-4259421769"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119347"}},"submitted_at":"2026-05-10T13:33:50Z","commit_id":"3bdb6355cfdd0103161118318da7cab0078312ed"},{"id":4262017405,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7-CTl9","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested this PR again and I'm still encountering 2 issues: \n\n1. The checkbox doesn't show the partial state when only part of the selection has the property enabled. It seems that its state depends on the first object that is selected. Video:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7c714b3a-865a-4c88-8676-5b0b67fb1071\n\nFor the avoidance of doubt, this is the partial checkbox I am talking about:\n\n<img width=\"26\" height=\"26\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/94ff4e79-69fc-4a2e-9776-99dde4f11af8\" />\n\n2. Clicking on an option where part of the selection has it enabled and another part has fairy random behavior. With the Load as Placeholder, it toggles it for each node individually, which is not great for usability. The Editable Children option seems to depend on the state of the highest one in the hierarchy or something?\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1d8af684-c795-4e54-9fef-7386f4c3cfd9\n\nRegardless, the expected behavior is that **clicking the partial checkbox should be the same as enabling it on the remaining items.** It then changes to the full check because it should then be enabled on all items. This is the current (unexpected / wrong) behavior, where you can see that it it simply toggled for each item individually so you do not end up enabling it for everything:\n\n----\n\nI also noticed that 'Access as Unique Name' actually also doesn't show the partial checkbox, which is a bug. Not sure this PR could or should fix it, but it's related to multi-select and if the fix is easy, it could 😎\n\n> Related: #83615\n\nIt seems that the other PR has waaaaaaay mode code than this one for the same functionality? Perhaps I am mistaken, but this PR would seem like a much better candidate for merging in that case.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119347#pullrequestreview-4262017405","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119347","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119347#pullrequestreview-4262017405"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119347"}},"submitted_at":"2026-05-11T08:52:29Z","commit_id":"57f58dc2ecbb59c4d38fcb919a7d099d95550348"},{"id":4317685016,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAVqlGA","user":{"login":"ajreckof","id":66184050,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTg0MDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66184050?u=48fa4d9bc97ee884ea8987ec8d70bbacddccb12f&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof","html_url":"https://github.com/ajreckof","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https